    <style>
        .interactive-process {
            position: relative;
            margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
            padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
        }

        .process-grid-modern {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--space-2xl);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .process-step-modern {
            position: relative;
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        .process-step-modern:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

        .step-indicator {
            position: relative;
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .step-number {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--white);
            z-index: 2;
            background: var(--gradient-primary);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .step-glow {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--gradient-glow);
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.15;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .process-step-modern:hover .step-glow {
            opacity: 0.4;
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        .step-content-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: var(--space-xl);
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .process-step-modern:hover .step-content-box {
            border-color: rgba(0, 102, 255, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .step-content-box h4 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .step-content-box p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--gray-400);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .process-grid-modern {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .process-grid-modern {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .step-indicator {
                margin-left: auto;
                margin-right: auto;
            }
            .step-content-box {
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="section" id="faq">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="label">FAQ</span>
                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <p>Common questions about our digital services and how we work with clients.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="faq-grid" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How does the consultation process work?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Our consultation starts with a discovery session where we learn about your business goals,
                            challenges, and current tech stack. We then provide a strategy roadmap with recommended
                            solutions tailored to your needs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Do you work with international clients?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes! We are a remote-first company and work with clients globally. We use modern
                            collaboration tools to ensure seamless communication and project delivery regardless of your
                            location.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Can you handle both design and development?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Absolutely. We provide end-to-end digital solutions, from initial brand strategy and UI/UX
                            design to full-scale programming and system implementation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How long does a typical project take?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Project timelines vary based on complexity. A brand identity might take 2-4 weeks, while a
                            complex web system might take 8-12 weeks. We provide detailed timelines during the strategy
                            phase.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>What is AI Studio and how does it work?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>AI Studio is our virtual production service. We use advanced AI tools to create high-quality
                            brand visuals, photos, and videos without the need for physical shoots, saving time and
                            costs while maintaining premium quality.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

